abstract: >-
  Audited analysis code for external longitudinal evaluation of SPIRS-P1 on
  the public Cyprus/PROTEAS brain-metastasis MRI dataset. The release covers
  denominator auditing, reference-mask relinking, cross-sectional rescoring,
  patient-clustered bootstrap confidence intervals, whole-burden change, and
  reference-anchored modified RANO-BM endpoints. It excludes imaging, clinical
  data, trained weights, predictions, and patient-level results.
